P. D. Magnus, Tim Button, Robert Trueman and Richard Zach, with contributions by J. Robert Loftis and Aaron Thomas-Bolduc. *forall x: Calgary*, displayed Fall 2025 edition, HTML revision bb86fe9 dated 22 October 2026; inspected 1 November 2026.

[Project and credits](https://forallx.openlogicproject.org/) · [Edition contents and notice](https://forallx.openlogicproject.org/bookml/) · [Truth in FOL](https://forallx.openlogicproject.org/bookml/Ch31.html) · [Semantic concepts](https://forallx.openlogicproject.org/bookml/Ch32.html) · [Soundness](https://forallx.openlogicproject.org/bookml/Ch48.html).

Inspected the edition/credits notice and selected passages on quantified truth, semantic consequence and the soundness invariant with induction and conjunction rules. Chapter 22's opening was also inspected; its complete argument was not audited. Assign chapters 27, 31–32 and 48 progressively, with the earlier natural-deduction preparation before the latter's complete exercises. Whole chapters, the complete proof system and all exercises are not claimed audited or performed.

